<title>USA: Time, News Corp in talks on carrying Fox - sources.</title>
<headline>Time, News Corp in talks on carrying Fox - sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp LTD and Time Warner Inc are in negotiations to put News Corp's Fox News channel on Time's cable TV system in New York, according to sources close to the talks.</p>
<p>&quot;It's pretty far along,&quot; said one source, who asked not to be identified. &quot;There could be something as soon as today.&quot;</p>
<p>Both News Corp and Time Warner declined to comment.</p>
